1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Koʻp narsalar bor ekan.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: „Mottainai“ madaniyati va ekologik tajribalar / Mottainai madaniyati va ekologik tajribalar

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:15,108
Ertalab yangiliklarni koʻrdingizmi?

4
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:18,164
Yoʻq, koʻrmadim.

5
00:00:18,187 --> 00:00:23,272
Yaponiyaning „mottainai“ yangiliklari.

6
00:00:23,295 --> 00:00:25,514
„Mottainai“mi?

7
00:00:25,537 --> 00:00:27,989
Qanday yangiliklar?

8
00:00:28,012 --> 00:00:32,546
Narsalarni qadrlash madaniyati haqidagi yangiliklar.

9
00:00:32,569 --> 00:00:37,102
Yaponlar narsalarni juda qadrlaydilar-ku.

10
00:00:37,125 --> 00:00:41,963
Chet elliklar uchun ekologik tajribalar juda mashhur.

11
00:00:41,987 --> 00:00:44,920
Qanday tajribalar bor?

12
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:49,577
Oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytiradigan kafe bor.

13
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,440
Ajoyib gʻoya ekan!

14
00:00:52,463 --> 00:00:56,263
Yaqin muddatda tugaydigan shirinliklar sotiladi.

15
00:00:56,286 --> 00:00:59,486
Arzon narxda sotib olish mumkin ekan.

16
00:00:59,509 --> 00:01:02,797
Mazali tortlar va nonlar bor.

17
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:06,154
Oziq-ovqatni tashlamaymiz, yaxshi ekan.

18
00:01:06,177 --> 00:01:09,675
„Kintsugi“ tajribasi ham bor.

19
00:01:09,698 --> 00:01:11,832
„Kintsugi“mi?

20
00:01:11,855 --> 00:01:15,421
Singan likopchalarga taʼmirlash texnikasi.

21
00:01:15,444 --> 00:01:19,135
Oltin bilan chiroyli qilib birlashtiriladi.

22
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:23,642
Yangi dizayn bilan juda chiroyli boʻladi.

23
00:01:23,665 --> 00:01:26,998
Qayta ishlatish doʻkonlari ham mashhur.

24
00:01:27,021 --> 00:01:29,355
Eski kiyimlar doʻkoni.

25
00:01:29,378 --> 00:01:33,378
Koʻp chiroyli kiyimlar va sumkalar bor.

26
00:01:33,401 --> 00:01:37,497
Arzon va sifatli kiyimlar sotib olish mumkin ekan.

27
00:01:37,521 --> 00:01:40,656
Oʻz butilkasini olib yuradiganlar ham koʻp.

28
00:01:40,679 --> 00:01:45,246
Shahardagi stendlardan suv quyish mumkin.

29
00:01:45,269 --> 00:01:48,669
Plastik chiqindilarni kamaytiramiz.

30
00:01:48,692 --> 00:01:52,025
Yer sayyorasi uchun yaxshi tashabbus ekan.

31
00:01:52,048 --> 00:01:55,648
Men ham ekologik tajriba qilishni xohlayman.

32
00:01:55,671 --> 00:02:00,038
Bugun oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytiradigan kafega boramizmi?

33
00:02:00,061 --> 00:02:04,145
Ha, oʻsha kafega borishni xohlayman.

34
00:02:04,168 --> 00:02:06,338
Shibuya shahrida joylashgan.

35
00:02:06,362 --> 00:02:09,895
„Kintsugi“ tajribasini ham band qilamiz.

36
00:02:09,918 --> 00:02:13,451
Internet orqali band qilish mumkin.

37
00:02:13,474 --> 00:02:16,474
Hozir darhol internet orqali band qilaman.

38
00:02:16,497 --> 00:02:19,746
Band qilib qoʻyish xotirjamlik beradi.

39
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:23,440
Yaponiyaning ekologik madaniyatini oʻrganamiz.

40
00:02:23,463 --> 00:02:26,796
Yangiliklar uchun rahmat.

41
00:02:26,819 --> 00:02:30,986
Yaponiyaning ekologik madaniyatidan zavqlanib kelamiz.

42
00:02:31,009 --> 00:02:34,609
Yaxshi kun boʻlishini tilayman!

43
00:02:34,632 --> 00:02:36,682
Ha, ketib kelaman.

44
00:02:36,705 --> 00:02:39,040
Xayr, ketib boring!

45
00:02:39,064 --> 00:02:58,081
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohlardan yuklab olish mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

46
00:02:58,081 --> 00:02:59,581
2-qism: Oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytiradigan kafe / Oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytirish kafesi

47
00:02:59,581 --> 00:03:01,748
Kechirasiz.

48
00:03:01,771 --> 00:03:07,404
Bu yer oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytiradigan kafemi?

49
00:03:07,427 --> 00:03:09,710
Xush kelibsiz!

50
00:03:09,733 --> 00:03:13,566
Ha, bu oziq-ovqat chiqindilarini kamaytiradigan kafe.

51
00:03:13,589 --> 00:03:16,523
Qanday mahsulotlar mavjud?

52
00:03:16,546 --> 00:03:20,280
Yaqin muddatda isteʼmol qilish muddati tugaydigan mahsulotlar bor.

53
00:03:20,303 --> 00:03:23,670
Shirinliklar va nonlar bor ekan.

54
00:03:23,693 --> 00:03:27,569
Supermarketdan yigʻilgan shirin va mazali shirinliklar!

55
00:03:27,592 --> 00:03:30,625
Qaysi shirinliklarni tavsiya qilasiz?

56
00:03:30,648 --> 00:03:33,982
Bu pechenyelarni tavsiya qilaman.

57
00:03:34,005 --> 00:03:38,677
Bu pechenyening isteʼmol qilish muddati qachongacha?

58
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:41,234
Ertaga qadar.

59
00:03:41,257 --> 00:03:45,990
Ertaga qadar, shuning uchun arzonlashtirilgan.

60
00:03:46,013 --> 00:03:49,424
Ha, yarim narxda — 200 yen.

61
00:03:49,448 --> 00:03:52,615
Yarim narx — juda arzon ekan!

62
00:03:52,638 --> 00:03:55,723
Mazasi ham juda yaxshi!

63
00:03:55,746 --> 00:03:58,879
Pechenyeni 2 quti olaman.

64
00:03:58,902 --> 00:04:00,835
Rahmat!

65
00:04:00,858 --> 00:04:03,792
Shokolad ham bormi?

66
00:04:03,815 --> 00:04:07,450
Ha, hashamatli shokoladlar bor.

67
00:04:07,473 --> 00:04:11,511
Bu shokoladning isteʼmol qilish muddati qachongacha?

68
00:04:11,535 --> 00:04:14,574
Indinga qadar.

69
00:04:14,598 --> 00:04:17,038
Shokolad qancha turadi?

70
00:04:17,061 --> 00:04:21,666
70% chegirma bilan 150 yen.

71
00:04:21,689 --> 00:04:24,097
150 yenmi?

72
00:04:24,121 --> 00:04:27,254
Juda arzon ekan!

73
00:04:27,277 --> 00:04:30,317
Tashlab yubormay sotish — ekologik, shunday emasmi?

74
00:04:30,341 --> 00:04:35,108
Shokoladni ham 2 dona olaman. Rahmat!

75
00:04:35,131 --> 00:04:38,264
Nonlar boʻlimiga ham qarab chiqay.

76
00:04:38,287 --> 00:04:41,144
Bugun ertalab pishirilgan nonlar ham bor.

77
00:04:41,168 --> 00:04:44,934
Shakli biroz buzilib ketgan koʻrinadi.

78
00:04:44,957 --> 00:04:48,731
Ha, shakli notekis boʻlgani uchun arzon.

79
00:04:48,755 --> 00:04:54,360
Nonni ham 1 paket olaman. Non 100 yen turadi, shundaymi?

80
00:04:54,384 --> 00:04:57,317
Hammasini hisobga oling, iltimos.

81
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:01,274
Pechenye, shokolad va non — jami 800 yen.

82
00:05:01,297 --> 00:05:06,737
Ming yenlik banknot beraman. 1000 yenni oldik.

83
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,647
200 yen qaytim.

84
00:05:09,671 --> 00:05:12,671
Mening sumkamga solaman.

85
00:05:12,694 --> 00:05:14,294
Rahmat!

86
00:05:14,317 --> 00:05:17,895
200 yen qaytim.

87
00:05:17,918 --> 00:05:21,724
Oziq-ovqat isrofiga barham berganingiz uchun raxmat!

88
00:05:21,748 --> 00:05:25,163
Mazali yeyib, ekologik boʻlish!

89
00:05:25,186 --> 00:05:27,586
Yana kelib turing!

90
00:05:27,609 --> 00:05:34,714
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

91
00:05:34,714 --> 00:05:36,214
3-Sahna: Kintsugi tajribasi / Kintsugi tajriba ustaxonasi

92
00:05:36,214 --> 00:05:38,261
Kechirasiz.

93
00:05:38,285 --> 00:05:42,552
Kintsugi tajriba darsiga keldim.

94
00:05:42,575 --> 00:05:44,941
Xush kelibsiz!

95
00:05:44,964 --> 00:05:48,631
Bu joyga oʻtiring.

96
00:05:48,654 --> 00:05:53,502
Singan chashkani chiroyli qilib tuzatmoqchiman.

97
00:05:53,526 --> 00:05:59,059
Ha, kintsugi bilan chiroyli qilib tuzatish mumkin.

98
00:05:59,082 --> 00:06:03,249
Birinchi marta, biroz xavotirdaman.

99
00:06:03,272 --> 00:06:07,155
Usta puxtalik bilan oʻrgatadi.

100
00:06:07,178 --> 00:06:09,468
Iltimos, yaxshi oʻrgatib bering.

101
00:06:09,492 --> 00:06:14,292
Avval singan qismlarni birlashtiramiz.

102
00:06:14,315 --> 00:06:19,082
Ish stolida qismlarni yigʻamiz.

103
00:06:19,105 --> 00:06:22,945
Maxsus tabiiy lakdan foydalanamiz.

104
00:06:22,969 --> 00:06:26,444
Lak bilan qismlarni yopishtiramizmi?

105
00:06:26,467 --> 00:06:30,234
Ha, lak bilan yopishtiramiz.

106
00:06:30,257 --> 00:06:32,926
Choʻtka bilan suraymiz.

107
00:06:32,949 --> 00:06:35,716
Oraliqqa surang, iltimos.

108
00:06:35,739 --> 00:06:38,672
Oraliqqa chiroyli suraymiz.

109
00:06:38,695 --> 00:06:43,373
Keyinroq jilvir bilan sirtini tekislab silliqlaymiz.

110
00:06:43,397 --> 00:06:47,531
Jilvir bilan yengil silliqlaymiz.

111
00:06:47,554 --> 00:06:50,687
Sirti silliq boʻlib qoldi-ku!

112
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:53,524
Ulanish chizigʻi paydo boʻldi.

113
00:06:53,548 --> 00:06:58,081
Oxirida haqiqiy oltin kukun sepamiz.

114
00:06:58,104 --> 00:07:01,152
Oltin kukun sepamiz.

115
00:07:01,176 --> 00:07:04,509
Choʻtka bilan yengil qilib kukunni qoʻying.

116
00:07:04,532 --> 00:07:08,899
A, oltin rangli chiroyli chiziq paydo boʻldi!

117
00:07:08,922 --> 00:07:12,990
Juda goʻzal kintsugi chiqdi-ku!

118
00:07:13,014 --> 00:07:16,820
Sinib ketgan joy sanʼatga aylandi.

119
00:07:16,843 --> 00:07:20,135
Bu Yaponiyaning „keraksiz narsa yoʻq“ madaniyati.

120
00:07:20,158 --> 00:07:26,358
Narsalarni qadrlash hissi yetib keladi, shunday emasmi?

121
00:07:26,381 --> 00:07:29,436
Taʼmirlangan chashkani olib ketishingiz mumkin.

122
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:32,793
Bugun olib ketishim mumkinmi?

123
00:07:32,816 --> 00:07:37,749
Ha, maxsus qutiga solib beramiz.

124
00:07:37,772 --> 00:07:40,782
Qurishi uchun necha kun kerak boʻladi?

125
00:07:40,805 --> 00:07:45,263
Toʻliq qurishi uchun bir necha kun kerak boʻladi.

126
00:07:45,287 --> 00:07:48,557
Uyni ehtiyotkorlik bilan quritaman.

127
00:07:48,581 --> 00:07:52,853
Mikrotoʻlqinli pech yoki idish yuvish mashinasidan foydalanmang.

128
00:07:52,877 --> 00:07:56,488
Ha, qoʻl bilan yengil yuvaman.

129
00:07:56,512 --> 00:08:01,761
Oʻzingiz taʼmirlagan chashkani qadrlab saqlang.

130
00:08:01,785 --> 00:08:05,757
Ajoyib tajriba boʻldi, juda taʼsirlandim!

131
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:10,064
Siz xursand boʻlgansiz, men ham xursandman.

132
00:08:10,088 --> 00:08:13,969
Batafsil oʻrgatganingiz uchun rahmat.

133
00:08:13,993 --> 00:08:16,126
Rahmat!

134
00:08:16,149 --> 00:08:17,649
4-qism: Eski kiyim izlash asoslari

135
00:08:17,649 --> 00:08:19,649
Kechirasiz.

136
00:08:19,672 --> 00:08:22,939
Chiroyli eski kiyim izlayapman.

137
00:08:22,962 --> 00:08:25,164
Xush kelibsiz!

138
00:08:25,188 --> 00:08:30,188
Ayollar uchun eski kiyimlar boʻlimi 2-qavatda joylashgan.

139
00:08:30,211 --> 00:08:33,377
2-qavatga zinapoya bilan koʻtarilamiz.

140
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:37,073
Lift ham ichkarida bor.

141
00:08:37,096 --> 00:08:39,953
Kiyimlar juda koʻp ekan!

142
00:08:39,977 --> 00:08:43,851
Brendli kiyimlar ham koʻp.

143
00:08:43,874 --> 00:08:46,612
Koʻylak izlamoqchiman.

144
00:08:46,636 --> 00:08:50,569
Bu javonda koʻylaklar bor.

145
00:08:50,592 --> 00:08:54,559
Bu koʻk koʻylak juda yoqimli ekan!

146
00:08:54,582 --> 00:08:59,454
Bu deyarli yangi holatdagi juda chiroyli kiyim.

147
00:08:59,477 --> 00:09:01,844
Holat yaxshi ekan.

148
00:09:01,866 --> 00:09:05,666
Hech qanday nuqson yoki iflos joy yoʻq.

149
00:09:05,689 --> 00:09:08,223
Bu M oʻlchammi?

150
00:09:08,246 --> 00:09:11,579
Ha, M oʻlcham.

151
00:09:11,602 --> 00:09:14,802
Kiyib koʻrish xonasida kiyib koʻrishim mumkinmi?

152
00:09:14,825 --> 00:09:19,402
Ha, bu kiyib koʻrish xonasida sinab koʻring.

153
00:09:19,426 --> 00:09:22,124
Oyoq kiyimni yechib kiraman.

154
00:09:22,147 --> 00:09:24,349
Katta oyna ham bor.

155
00:09:24,373 --> 00:09:26,976
Qanday boʻldi?

156
00:09:26,999 --> 00:09:29,399
Aniq oʻlcham ekan!

157
00:09:29,422 --> 00:09:31,856
Juda mos keladi.

158
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,963
Narxi qancha?

159
00:09:33,987 --> 00:09:38,606
Asl narxining yarmi – 2500 yen.

160
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:42,236
2500 yen juda arzon narx ekan.

161
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:46,935
Bu qayta ishlatiladigan doʻkon, shuning uchun arzon narxda sotib olishingiz mumkin.

162
00:09:46,958 --> 00:09:50,025
Jeket ham qidirib koʻrmoqchiman.

163
00:09:50,049 --> 00:09:53,316
Bu yerda qora jeket bor.

164
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:56,306
Matosi juda pishiq ekan.

165
00:09:56,329 --> 00:09:59,013
Bu brendli jeket.

166
00:09:59,037 --> 00:10:01,711
Jeket narxi qancha?

167
00:10:01,734 --> 00:10:05,191
Jeket 3000 yen turadi.

168
00:10:05,215 --> 00:10:08,293
Koʻylak va jeketni olaman.

169
00:10:08,317 --> 00:10:12,012
Jami 5500 yen boʻladi.

170
00:10:12,035 --> 00:10:16,268
Pasport koʻrsatilsa, soliqsiz xarid qilish mumkinmi?

171
00:10:16,291 --> 00:10:20,491
Ha, pasport koʻrsatilsa, soliqsiz xarid qilishingiz mumkin.

172
00:10:20,514 --> 00:10:23,186
Pasportimni koʻrsataman.

173
00:10:23,209 --> 00:10:25,142
Rahmat!

174
00:10:25,165 --> 00:10:27,899
5000 yenga chegirma qilamiz.

175
00:10:27,922 --> 00:10:30,939
Kredit karta bilan toʻlayman.

176
00:10:30,962 --> 00:10:33,054
Kartangizni olamiz.

177
00:10:33,078 --> 00:10:35,878
Toʻlov yakunlandi.

178
00:10:35,901 --> 00:10:37,434
Rahmat!

179
00:10:37,457 --> 00:10:39,824
Yana kelib turing!

180
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:41,347
5-sahna: Koʻp marta ishlatiladigan butilkani tanlash / Koʻp marta ishlatiladigan butilkani qanday tanlash kerak

181
00:10:41,347 --> 00:10:43,547
Kechirasiz.

182
00:10:43,570 --> 00:10:46,416
Koʻp marta ishlatiladigan butilka qidiryapman.

183
00:10:46,439 --> 00:10:48,283
Xush kelibsiz!

184
00:10:48,306 --> 00:10:52,800
Bu yerda zanglamaydigan poʻlatdan yasalgan butilkalar bor.

185
00:10:52,823 --> 00:10:56,116
Uni qayta-qayta ishlatish mumkinmi?

186
00:10:56,139 --> 00:10:57,618
Ha.

187
00:10:57,642 --> 00:11:01,334
Uni koʻp marta ishlatishingiz mumkin.

188
00:11:01,357 --> 00:11:04,891
Sovuq suv solish mumkinmi?

189
00:11:04,914 --> 00:11:06,447
Ha.

190
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:10,245
Sovuq suv solishingiz mumkin.

191
00:11:10,269 --> 00:11:13,469
Issiq choy ham quyish mumkinmi?

192
00:11:13,492 --> 00:11:16,659
Issiq saqlash funksiyasi mavjud.

193
00:11:16,682 --> 00:11:19,571
Issiq choy ham quyishingiz mumkin.

194
00:11:19,594 --> 00:11:22,848
Sigʻimi qancha?

195
00:11:22,871 --> 00:11:26,071
500 millilitr sigʻadi.

196
00:11:26,094 --> 00:11:28,583
Aniq mos oʻlcham ekan.

197
00:11:28,606 --> 00:11:32,046
Yengil va juda yaxshi.

198
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:34,324
Qanday ranglari bor?

199
00:11:34,347 --> 00:11:38,280
Oq, qora va pushti ranglari bor.

200
00:11:38,303 --> 00:11:41,437
Oq butilkani koʻrsatib bering.

201
00:11:41,460 --> 00:11:42,993
Ha.

202
00:11:43,016 --> 00:11:45,633
Bu oq rangdagi butilka.

203
00:11:45,656 --> 00:11:49,023
Dizayni sodda va chiroyli ekan.

204
00:11:49,046 --> 00:11:51,979
Yuvish ham oson.

205
00:11:52,002 --> 00:11:54,847
Qopqogʻini ochib yuvish kerakmi?

206
00:11:54,871 --> 00:11:56,511
Ha.

207
00:11:56,535 --> 00:11:59,580
Qopqogʻini ochib yuving.

208
00:11:59,603 --> 00:12:03,262
Shaharda suv quyish mumkinmi?

209
00:12:03,285 --> 00:12:04,729
Ha.

210
00:12:04,752 --> 00:12:08,552
Bepul suv quyish stendlari bor.

211
00:12:08,575 --> 00:12:11,511
Plastik butilkalarni kamaytiramiz.

212
00:12:11,534 --> 00:12:14,968
Plastik chiqindilarni kamaytirish mumkin.

213
00:12:14,992 --> 00:12:17,434
Narxi qancha?

214
00:12:17,457 --> 00:12:21,657
Soliq bilan 2200 yen boʻladi.

215
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:24,913
Bu oq butilkani olaman.

216
00:12:24,936 --> 00:12:26,870
Rahmat!

217
00:12:26,893 --> 00:12:30,126
Qutiga solib berish mumkinmi?

218
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:34,282
Qutiga solib, lenta bogʻlaymiz.

219
00:12:34,305 --> 00:12:36,924
Sovgʻa uchun qilib qoʻying, iltimos.

220
00:12:36,948 --> 00:12:38,481
Ha.

221
00:12:38,504 --> 00:12:41,105
Chiroyli qilib oʻraymiz.

222
00:12:41,129 --> 00:12:43,929
Kredit kartasi bilan toʻlayman.

223
00:12:43,951 --> 00:12:48,151
Kartangizni shu terminalga tekkizing.

224
00:12:48,174 --> 00:12:49,608
Ha.

225
00:12:49,631 --> 00:12:51,397
Tekkizaman.

226
00:12:51,421 --> 00:12:54,554
Chek va kartangizni qaytarib beraman.

227
00:12:54,577 --> 00:12:58,144
Mening termoshimni paketga solaman.

228
00:12:58,167 --> 00:13:00,016
Rahmat!

229
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:03,573
Aniq tushuntirib berganingiz uchun katta rahmat.

230
00:13:03,596 --> 00:13:05,649
Rahmat!

231
00:13:05,672 --> 00:13:07,172
6-SAHNA: Oziq-ovqat soliqlarining yangi yangilanishi / Yaponiyadagi oziq-ovqat soligʻini pasaytirish yangiliklari

232
00:13:07,172 --> 00:13:10,806
Ertalab yangiliklarni koʻrdingizmi?

233
00:13:10,829 --> 00:13:13,704
Yoʻq, koʻrmadim.

234
00:13:13,727 --> 00:13:18,421
Yaponiyadagi oziq-ovqat soligʻini pasaytirish haqidagi yangiliklar.

235
00:13:18,445 --> 00:13:21,251
Oziq-ovqat soligʻini pasaytirishmi?

236
00:13:21,274 --> 00:13:23,641
Qanday yangiliklar?

237
00:13:23,664 --> 00:13:28,321
Oziq-ovqat soligʻi arzonlashadi.

238
00:13:28,344 --> 00:13:32,077
Soliq arzonlashsa, yaxshi boʻladi-ku.

239
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:38,067
Oziq-ovqat va ichimliklar soligʻi 1% boʻladi.

240
00:13:38,090 --> 00:13:40,690
1%mi?

241
00:13:40,713 --> 00:13:43,385
Juda arzon ekan-ku!

242
00:13:43,408 --> 00:13:48,175
Narsalar arzonlashib, yordam beradi.

243
00:13:48,198 --> 00:13:51,531
Chet elliklar ham arzon narxda xarid qila oladimi?

244
00:13:51,554 --> 00:13:55,888
Ha, hamma arzon narxda xarid qila oladi.

245
00:13:55,911 --> 00:13:59,919
Supermarketda xarid qilishni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

246
00:13:59,942 --> 00:14:03,509
Tejamkorlik bilan ovqatlanish ham ommalashmoqda.

247
00:14:03,532 --> 00:14:06,899
Tejamkorlik bilan ovqatlanish nima?

248
00:14:06,922 --> 00:14:10,931
Arzon va mazali taomlar.

249
00:14:10,954 --> 00:14:14,045
Qanday taomlar bor?

250
00:14:14,069 --> 00:14:18,035
Kechqurun supermarketlardagi bentolar arzon.

251
00:14:18,058 --> 00:14:24,354
Kechqurun arzonlashadi. Chegirma stikerlari yopishadi.

252
00:14:24,378 --> 00:14:28,017
Bentolarni yarim narxda xarid qilsa boʻladi.

253
00:14:28,041 --> 00:14:31,374
Univermag yer ostidagi tayyor taomlar ham arzon.

254
00:14:31,397 --> 00:14:35,364
Koʻp mazali doʻkonlar bor ekan-ku.

255
00:14:35,387 --> 00:14:39,154
Tijorat koʻchasidagi kroketlar ham juda mazali.

256
00:14:39,177 --> 00:14:42,710
Bitta 100 yenga sotib olsa boʻladi?

257
00:14:42,733 --> 00:14:47,133
Ha, bitta 100 yenga sotib olsa boʻladi.

258
00:14:47,156 --> 00:14:51,004
Arzon va mazali doʻkonlarni qidiraman.

259
00:14:51,027 --> 00:14:55,126
Birga tejamkorlik bilan ovqatlanamiz.

260
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:58,008
Bugun kechqurun supermarketga boramizmi?

261
00:14:58,032 --> 00:15:02,504
Ha, soat 19:00 da supermarketga boramiz.

262
00:15:02,527 --> 00:15:06,060
Yarim narxdagi bentolarni qidiramiz.

263
00:15:06,083 --> 00:15:09,017
Chegirmadagi sushilarni ham olamiz.

264
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:12,173
Saat 19:00 da mehmonxonada uchrashamiz.

265
00:15:12,196 --> 00:15:16,168
Mazali sushilarni tanlaymiz.

266
00:15:16,192 --> 00:15:19,242
Yangiliklar uchun rahmat.

267
00:15:19,265 --> 00:15:22,147
Yaxshi xarid qilamiz.

268
00:15:22,171 --> 00:15:25,008
Ha, intiqlik bilan kutaman.

269
00:15:25,032 --> 00:15:27,565
Keyinroq koʻrishamiz.

270
00:15:27,588 --> 00:15:29,088
7-SAHNA: Chegirma stikerlarini tushunish / Chegirma stikerlarini qanday oʻqish kerakligi

271
00:15:29,088 --> 00:15:30,965
Kechirasiz.

272
00:15:30,989 --> 00:15:34,286
Bento boʻlimi qayerda?

273
00:15:34,309 --> 00:15:36,309
Xush kelibsiz!

274
00:15:36,332 --> 00:15:39,934
Oxirida oʻng tomonda.

275
00:15:39,958 --> 00:15:43,562
Bentolar koʻp joylashgan ekan.

276
00:15:43,585 --> 00:15:47,952
Kechqurun soat 19:00 da chegirma stikerlari yopiladi.

277
00:15:47,975 --> 00:15:50,951
A, stikerlar yopishdi-ku.

278
00:15:50,974 --> 00:15:52,374
Ha.

279
00:15:52,397 --> 00:15:56,416
Sariq yorliqda 30% chegirma bor.

280
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:59,773
30% arzonroqmi?

281
00:15:59,796 --> 00:16:01,196
Ha.

282
00:16:01,219 --> 00:16:05,086
30% arzonroq sotib olishingiz mumkin.

283
00:16:05,109 --> 00:16:08,361
Qizil yorliq nima?

284
00:16:08,384 --> 00:16:12,318
Qizil yorliqda yarim narxda sotiladi.

285
00:16:12,341 --> 00:16:15,107
50% chegirmami?

286
00:16:15,130 --> 00:16:17,145
Ajoyib!

287
00:16:17,169 --> 00:16:20,769
Bu tonkatsu bentosi yarim narxda!

288
00:16:20,792 --> 00:16:23,434
Asl narxi qancha?

289
00:16:23,457 --> 00:16:27,591
Asl narxi 600 yen.

290
00:16:27,614 --> 00:16:30,861
Yarim narxda 300 yen ekan.

291
00:16:30,884 --> 00:16:32,553
Ha.

292
00:16:32,576 --> 00:16:35,452
300 yenga sotib olishingiz mumkin.

293
00:16:35,476 --> 00:16:38,642
Makunouchi bentosi ham bormi?

294
00:16:38,665 --> 00:16:40,399
Ha.

295
00:16:40,422 --> 00:16:44,755
Makunouchi bentosiga ham yarim narx yorligʻi yopishtiramiz.

296
00:16:44,778 --> 00:16:47,516
Ichida losos va tenpura bor.

297
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:50,273
Juda mazali va boy bentolar!

298
00:16:50,296 --> 00:16:54,498
Tonkatsu va makunouchi bentolarini olaman.

299
00:16:54,521 --> 00:16:57,388
Ikki dona 600 yen bo‘ladi.

300
00:16:57,411 --> 00:17:00,219
Choy ham arzonroqmi?

301
00:17:00,242 --> 00:17:04,280
Choyda ham 20% chegirma bor.

302
00:17:04,304 --> 00:17:07,275
Choy ham bitta olaman.

303
00:17:07,298 --> 00:17:10,341
Choy 80 yen bo‘ladi.

304
00:17:10,364 --> 00:17:14,098
Hammasini hisobga oling, iltimos.

305
00:17:14,121 --> 00:17:18,854
Ikki bento va choy 680 yen.

306
00:17:18,877 --> 00:17:22,447
Ming yenlik banknot beraman.

307
00:17:22,471 --> 00:17:24,871
1000 yenni qabul qildik.

308
00:17:24,894 --> 00:17:28,165
320 yen qaytim bo‘ladi.

309
00:17:28,188 --> 00:17:31,321
Chek va qaytimni oldim.

310
00:17:31,344 --> 00:17:34,477
Ikkita xashak qo‘shaman.

311
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:37,434
Xashak qo‘shib berganingizdan xursandman.

312
00:17:37,457 --> 00:17:41,127
Mikroto‘lqinli pechda isitib yeganingizda yanada mazali bo‘ladi.

313
00:17:41,150 --> 00:17:45,323
Mehmonxonadagi mikroto‘lqinli pechda isitaman.

314
00:17:45,346 --> 00:17:46,795
Rahmat!

315
00:17:46,819 --> 00:17:49,396
Yana kelib turing!

316
00:17:49,419 --> 00:17:50,919
8-sahna: Univermag yerto‘lasidagi mashhur tayyor taomlar

317
00:17:50,919 --> 00:17:52,986
Kechirasiz.

318
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:57,621
Mashhur tayyor taomlar sotib olishga keldim.

319
00:17:57,644 --> 00:17:59,698
Xush kelibsiz!

320
00:17:59,722 --> 00:18:02,813
Univermag yerto‘lasiga xush kelibsiz!

321
00:18:02,836 --> 00:18:06,770
Eng mashhur tayyor taom qaysi?

322
00:18:06,793 --> 00:18:11,261
Bu qisqichbaqa chili sousi juda mashhur!

323
00:18:11,284 --> 00:18:13,617
Qisqichbaqa chili ekan.

324
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:16,507
Juda mazali ko‘rinib turibdi.

325
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:20,463
Ichida katta va yangi qisqichbaqalar bor.

326
00:18:20,486 --> 00:18:25,583
Vazniga qarab sotib olish mumkinmi?

327
00:18:25,606 --> 00:18:30,482
Ha, 100 grammdan sotib olishingiz mumkin.

328
00:18:30,506 --> 00:18:33,563
100 grammi qancha?

329
00:18:33,586 --> 00:18:37,453
100 grammi 400 yen.

330
00:18:37,476 --> 00:18:40,111
200 gramm bering.

331
00:18:40,134 --> 00:18:42,668
200 gramm, tushunarli.

332
00:18:42,691 --> 00:18:46,383
Maxsus paketga solib beraman.

333
00:18:46,406 --> 00:18:49,460
Kartoshka salati ham bormi?

334
00:18:49,484 --> 00:18:54,324
Ha, uyda tayyorlangan kartoshka salati bor.

335
00:18:54,348 --> 00:18:58,714
Kartoshka salatidan ham 100 gramm bering.

336
00:18:58,737 --> 00:19:03,504
Kartoshka salati 100 grammi 200 yen.

337
00:19:03,527 --> 00:19:07,385
Shaffof paketga solib berishingiz mumkinmi?

338
00:19:07,409 --> 00:19:11,383
Maxsus shaffof paketga solamiz.

339
