366
00:20:42,038 --> 00:20:44,671
Hozirgina qovurilganmi?

367
00:20:44,694 --> 00:20:48,694
Ha, hozirgina qovurib chiqardik.

368
00:20:48,717 --> 00:20:52,010
Issiq kroket yeyishni xohlayman.

369
00:20:52,033 --> 00:20:55,800
Issiq-issiq kroketni beramiz.

370
00:20:55,823 --> 00:20:58,356
Bittasi qancha?

371
00:20:58,379 --> 00:21:02,456
Bittasi 120 yen.

372
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,480
Ikki dona olaman.

373
00:21:04,503 --> 00:21:10,870
Ikki dona 240 yen boʻladi. Menchi kotlet ham bormi?

374
00:21:10,892 --> 00:21:14,961
Ha, mol goʻshtidan tayyorlangan menchi kotlet ham bor.

375
00:21:14,985 --> 00:21:17,918
Menchi kotlet qancha turadi?

376
00:21:17,941 --> 00:21:22,385
Menchi kotlet bittasi 180 yen.

377
00:21:22,408 --> 00:21:25,026
Menchi kotletdan ham bittasini bering.

378
00:21:25,050 --> 00:21:29,650
Jami 420 yen boʻladi.

379
00:21:29,673 --> 00:21:33,406
Qogʻoz sumkaga solib berishingiz mumkinmi?

380
00:21:33,429 --> 00:21:36,965
Ha, qogʻoz sumkaga solamiz.

381
00:21:36,989 --> 00:21:40,522
Shu yerda darhol yeyish mumkinmi?

382
00:21:40,545 --> 00:21:44,884
Doʻkon oldidagi skameykada yeyishingiz mumkin.

383
00:21:44,907 --> 00:21:47,274
Skameykada yeyaman.

384
00:21:47,297 --> 00:21:49,430
Sous quyaymi?

385
00:21:49,453 --> 00:21:52,140
Sous quyib bering.

386
00:21:52,164 --> 00:21:54,997
Maxsus sous quyib qoʻydik.

387
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:58,079
Xushtor va juda mazali ekan!

388
00:21:58,102 --> 00:22:01,636
Bu goʻsht doʻkonining qoʻlda tayyorlangan kroketi.

389
00:22:01,659 --> 00:22:05,351
Ichidagi kartoshka yumshoq va mazali.

390
00:22:05,375 --> 00:22:07,980
Yangidan tayyorlangan ovqatlar shunchalik mazali boʻladi-ku!

391
00:22:08,003 --> 00:22:11,370
500 yenlik tanga bilan toʻlayman.

392
00:22:11,393 --> 00:22:14,968
500 soʻmni sizdan olamiz.

393
00:22:14,992 --> 00:22:18,525
80 soʻm qaytim qoladi.

394
00:22:18,548 --> 00:22:20,846
Qaytimni oldim.

395
00:22:20,870 --> 00:22:24,744
Axlat qutisi skameyka yonida joylashgan.

396
00:22:24,768 --> 00:22:28,339
Qogʻoz sumkani axlat qutisiga tashlaymiz.

397
00:22:28,362 --> 00:22:31,208
Koʻchada ovqatlanishdan zavqlaning!

398
00:22:31,232 --> 00:22:34,449
Mazali kroket uchun raxmat!

399
00:22:34,473 --> 00:22:36,939
Rahmat!

400
00:22:36,962 --> 00:22:39,533
Yana kelib turing!

401
