Ichib ovqatlanishni tanladingiz, shundaymi?

408
00:22:57,068 --> 00:22:59,938
Soliq oʻzgarmoqda?

409
00:22:59,962 --> 00:23:01,495
Ha,

410
00:23:01,518 --> 00:23:05,534
Doʻkon ichida ovqatlanish 10% soliqqa ega.

411
00:23:05,557 --> 00:23:08,571
Olib ketish qancha boʻladi?

412
00:23:08,594 --> 00:23:13,462
Olib ketish uchun chegirma soliq stavkasi 8%.

413
00:23:13,486 --> 00:23:17,101
Soliq 2% ga farq qiladi.

414
00:23:17,124 --> 00:23:18,524
Ha,

415
00:23:18,547 --> 00:23:22,719
Doʻkon ichida ovqatlanganda 10% soliq olinadi.

416
00:23:22,742 --> 00:23:24,542
Tushunarli.

417
00:23:24,566 --> 00:23:27,366
Ichib ovqatlanaman.

418
00:23:27,389 --> 00:23:32,155
Demak, 10% soliq stavkasi bilan hisoblaymiz.

419
00:23:32,178 --> 00:23:36,423
Hisob-kitob jami 550 soʻm boʻladi.

420
00:23:36,446 --> 00:23:40,980
Transport IC-kartasi bilan toʻlayman.

421
00:23:41,003 --> 00:23:43,403
Bu yerga teging.

422
00:23:43,426 --> 00:23:46,113
Toʻlov yakunlandi.

423
00:23:46,136 --> 00:23:50,144
Onigirini isitib berish mumkinmi?

424
00:23:50,167 --> 00:23:51,737
Ha,

425
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:54,227
Mikrotoʻlqinli pechda isitamiz.

426
00:23:54,250 --> 00:23:58,147
Issiq onigiri yeyishni xohlayman.

427
00:23:58,171 --> 00:24:01,337
Mikrotoʻlqinli pechda 15 soniya isitildi.

428
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:04,694
Kafe latte uchun stakan olaman.

429
00:24:04,717 --> 00:24:06,126
Ha,

430
00:24:06,149 --> 00:24:09,682
Bu yerda L oʻlchamidagi stakan.

431
00:24:09,705 --> 00:24:13,672
Kofe mashinasidagi kafe latte tugmasini bosing.

432
00:24:13,695 --> 00:24:15,568
Tushunarli.

433
00:24:15,591 --> 00:24:18,758
Mazali kafe latte tayyor boʻladi.

434
00:24:18,781 --> 00:24:22,453
Ovqatlanish joyida rozetkalar ham bor.

435
00:24:22,476 --> 00:24:25,613
Ixtiyoriy joyga oʻtiring.

436
00:24:25,636 --> 00:24:28,403
Zaryadlash imkoniyati juda foydali.

437
00:24:28,426 --> 00:24:32,277
Bepul Wi-Fi ham ishlatishingiz mumkin.

438
00:24:32,300 --> 00:24:35,533
Oʻtirib, sekin ovqatlanaman.

439
00:24:35,556 --> 00:24:40,123
Axlatni ovqatlanish joyi yonidagi axlat qutisiga tashlang.

440
00:24:40,146 --> 00:24:42,226
Ovqatlanishingizdan zavqlaning.

441
00:24:42,250 --> 00:24:45,744
Batafsil tushuntirib berganingiz uchun raxmat.

442
00:24:45,767 --> 00:24:47,781
